{"4588930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Old Flesh of Nuraga", "steam_appid": 4588930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5100750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stranded in the desert among ancient ruins. Grandpa believes the ominous relics beneath the sands will make his greatest wishes come true. Meanwhile, you hear a Voice in your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nuraga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brief (1 to 2 hours) treasure-hunting horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth ancient relics in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/cd9fbb8fb588b2794b4d8b0e7d09983c.poster.avif?t=1787912462\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/cd9fbb8fb588b2794b4d8b0e7d09983c.webm?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/cd9fbb8fb588b2794b4d8b0e7d09983c.mp4?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bear with Grandpa.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He blathers. He lies. He loves you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/003373f9647d1f1cb465111857121856.poster.avif?t=1787912462\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/003373f9647d1f1cb465111857121856.webm?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/003373f9647d1f1cb465111857121856.mp4?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the horrors of the past.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things should stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/2902a46a58dae7687a030959d2d7a458.poster.avif?t=1787912462\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/2902a46a58dae7687a030959d2d7a458.webm?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/2902a46a58dae7687a030959d2d7a458.mp4?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stranded in the desert among ancient ruins. Grandpa believes the ominous relics beneath the sands will make his greatest wishes come true. Meanwhile, you hear a Voice in your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nuraga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brief (1 to 2 hours) treasure-hunting horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth ancient relics in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/cd9fbb8fb588b2794b4d8b0e7d09983c.poster.avif?t=1787912462\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588930/extras/cd9fbb8fb588b2794b4d8b0e7d09983c.webm?t=1787912462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http